<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia KLIH ends yr to March in losses.</title>
<headline>Malaysia KLIH ends yr to March in losses.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>		     (In million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit	  Loss   11.76	  vs    Profit  17.17</p>
<p>    Shr	(cents)  Loss    4.1	   vs    Profit   6.3</p>
<p>    Turnover		    347.63	  vs	     217.62</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit    Loss    5.64	  vs    Profit  26.29</p>
<p>    Minorities		    0.12	  vs    Less     0.04</p>
<p>NOTE - Kuala Lumpur Industries Holdings Bhd is involved in construction, property development, insurance and electrical products manufacturing. Its losses were a result of a slowdown in the property market and the start up costs of MEC, its electrical products project, the company said.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
</text>
